<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The Company recognized depreciation expense of $35,495
and $19,919 for the years ended December 31, 2022, and 2021, respectively related to property and equipment and amortization expense of
$956,144 and $146,737 for the years ended December 31, 2022, and 2021, respectively related to software development costs.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Note
3 &#8211; Accounts Payable and Accrued Liabilities</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Accounts payable and accrued liabilities consist of
the following:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

