<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">During the year ended December 31, 2022, the Company
granted 282,983 restricted stock units. Under terms of the restricted stock agreements, the restricted stock units are subject to certain
vesting requirements.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The Company recognized share-based compensation expense
related to stock options and restricted stock units of $1,001,889 and $1,237,481 for the years ended December 31, 2022, and 2021, respectively.
The remaining unvested share-based compensation expense of $1,616,569 is expected to be recognized over the next 37 months.</p>

