of the outstanding warrants are currently exercisable and have a weighted average remaining contractual life of approximately <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerms_dtY_c20230101__20230930__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember_z6RpIzV3f96e" title="Warrants remaining contractual life"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-012023-09-30_us-gaap_WarrantMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerms">2.69</ix:nonNumeric></span> years
as of September 30, 2023.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_23D_zsrqHbtAdJV7" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

